---
const controls = [
  { id: "draft", label: "下書き", meta: "編集中", tone: "neutral" },
  { id: "publish", label: "公開", meta: "未公開", tone: "muted" },
];
---

<html lang="ja" data-theme="light">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="記事編集ワークスペースのヘッダーUIチェック用プロトタイプ" />
    <title>記事編集ヘッダー | UIチェック用プロトタイプ</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="app-shell">
      <aside class="sidebar" aria-label="プロトタイプ情報">
        <a class="brand" href="/admin/ui-prototype/" aria-label="UIプロトタイプの概要へ戻る">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">A</span>
          <span class="brand-copy"><strong>Atlasez</strong><small>UIチェック</small></span>
        </a>
        <div class="side-rule"></div>
        <p class="side-kicker">INDEPENDENT PAGE</p>
        <h1 class="side-title">記事編集<br />ワークスペース</h1>
        <p class="side-description">本番の編集画面には触れず、ヘッダーと操作群だけを確認するための独立ビューです。</p>
        <div class="side-note"><span class="note-dot"></span><span>本番未反映</span></div>
      </aside>

      <main class="workspace">
        <header class="topbar">
          <div class="crumbs"><a href="/admin/ui-prototype/">UIプロトタイプ</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><strong>編集ヘッダー</strong></div>
          <div class="top-actions">
            <span class="read-only"><span class="read-dot"></span>チェック用</span>
            <button class="icon-button" type="button" data-theme-toggle aria-label="テーマを切り替え">◐</button>
            <span class="avatar" aria-label="現在のユーザー">UK</span>
          </div>
        </header>

        <div class="page-content">
          <div class="intro-row">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">ARTICLE EDITOR / HEADER EXPLORATION</p>
              <h2>操作群をひとつの流れに整理</h2>
              <p class="lede">状態・保存・プレビューを分離し、必要な操作だけを短い距離で見つけられるようにした案です。</p>
            </div>
            <span class="version">v0.1 · desktop</span>
          </div>

          <section class="workspace-frame" aria-label="記事編集ヘッダーの提案">
            <div class="frame-topline">
              <div class="workspace-context">
                <span class="context-mark" aria-hidden="true">文</span>
                <div><span class="context-label">Atlas / mathematics</span><strong>統計的機械学習の基礎</strong></div>
              </div>
              <div class="frame-actions"><button class="quiet-button" type="button" data-shortcut>⌘ K <span>操作を検索</span></button><button class="more-button" type="button" data-menu aria-label="その他の操作">•••</button></div>
            </div>

            <div class="status-row">
              <div class="segmented" role="group" aria-label="記事状態">
                {controls.map((control, index) => <button class:list={["segment", index === 0 && "is-active"]} type="button" data-status={control.id} aria-pressed={index === 0 ? "true" : "false"}><span class="segment-label">{control.label}</span><span class="segment-meta">{control.meta}</span></button>)}
              </div>
              <div class="status-message"><span class="status-dot is-green"></span><span>自動公開: 接続済み</span></div>
              <div class="status-spacer"></div>
              <button class="utility-button" type="button" data-guide>手順 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
              <label class="check-control"><input type="checkbox" checked data-autosave /><span class="fake-check" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>下書きを自動保存</span></label>
              <label class="select-control"><span class="sr-only">数式エンジン</span><select><option>KaTeX（高速）</option><option>MathJax</option></select><span class="select-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></label>
            </div>

            <div class="title-row">
              <div class="title-copy"><h3>統計的機械学習の基礎: 確率モデルと正則化</h3><span>最終更新 2分前 · 下書き</span><span class="created-by">初回作成: <strong>上杉 和輝</strong> · 2026/09/02</span></div>
              <div class="collab"><div class="history-avatars" aria-label="編集履歴"><button type="button" class="history-avatar avatar-uk" data-editor="上杉 和輝 · 初回作成" title="上杉 和輝 · 初回作成">UK</button><button type="button" class="history-avatar avatar-ms" data-editor="三浦 さき · 3時間前に編集" title="三浦 さき · 3時間前に編集">MS</button><button type="button" class="history-avatar avatar-kt" data-editor="加藤 拓 · 昨日に編集" title="加藤 拓 · 昨日に編集">KT</button></div><button type="button" class="history-link" data-history>編集履歴 <span>3</span></button><span class="collab-separator"></span><span>共同編集 2人</span></div>
            </div>

            <div class="history-panel is-hidden" data-history-panel><div><strong>編集履歴</strong><span>この下書きに変更を加えたメンバー</span></div><ul><li><span class="history-mini avatar-uk">UK</span><span><strong>上杉 和輝</strong><small>初回作成 · 2026/09/02 09:14</small></span></li><li><span class="history-mini avatar-ms">MS</span><span><strong>三浦 さき</strong><small>本文を編集 · 3時間前</small></span></li><li><span class="history-mini avatar-kt">KT</span><span><strong>加藤 拓</strong><small>コメントを追加 · 昨日</small></span></li></ul></div>

            <div class="action-row">
              <div class="tab-list" role="tablist" aria-label="編集ビュー">
                <button class="tab is-active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-tab="body">本文</button>
                <button class="tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="preview">プレビュー</button>
                <button class="tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="comments">コメント <span class="count">3</span></button>
                <button class="tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="notes">執筆メモ</button>
              </div>
              <div class="primary-actions"><button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-feedback>フィードバックを依頼</button><button class="primary-button" type="button" data-save>保存する</button></div>
            </div>

            <div class="panel-preview" data-panel="body" role="tabpanel"><div class="editor-line"><span class="line-number">01</span><span class="line-text">確率モデルは、観測データと潜在変数の関係を記述する。</span></div><div class="editor-line"><span class="line-number">02</span><span class="line-text muted-line">必要な操作が見つかるまで、ツールバーを増やさない。</span></div><div class="editor-line"><span class="line-number">03</span><span class="line-text"><span class="inline-tag">定義</span> 読みやすさと密度のバランスを保つ。</span></div></div>
            <div class="panel-preview is-hidden" data-panel="preview" role="tabpanel"><div class="preview-heading">プレビュー</div><p>記事の公開時に表示される見た目をここで確認できます。</p></div>
            <div class="panel-preview is-hidden" data-panel="comments" role="tabpanel"><div class="preview-heading">コメント 3件</div><p>レビュー依頼や修正の履歴を一か所にまとめます。</p></div>
            <div class="panel-preview is-hidden" data-panel="notes" role="tabpanel"><div class="preview-heading">執筆メモ</div><p>自分だけのメモは本文と分けて保持されます。</p></div>
          </section>

          <section class="comparison" aria-label="設計判断">
            <div><span class="comparison-label">DESIGN INTENT</span><strong>左から右へ、文脈 → 状態 → 操作</strong></div>
            <p>状態を色面で強調せず、隣接する明度差と小さなステータスで伝えます。保存は最後に一つだけ置き、誤操作を防ぎます。</p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-popover is-hidden" data-popover><button type="button">ショートカット一覧</button><button type="button">記事設定を開く</button><button type="button">変更履歴を見る</button></div>
    <div class="toast is-hidden" data-toast role="status"></div>

    <script is:inline>
      const root = document.documentElement;
      const toggle = document.querySelector('[data-theme-toggle]');
      toggle?.addEventListener('click', () => { root.dataset.theme = root.dataset.theme === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark'; });
      const popover = document.querySelector('[data-popover]');
      document.querySelector('[data-menu]')?.addEventListener('click', () => popover?.classList.toggle('is-hidden'));
      document.addEventListener('click', (event) => { if (!(event.target instanceof Element)) return; if (!event.target.closest('[data-menu]') && !event.target.closest('[data-popover]')) popover?.classList.add('is-hidden'); });
      const toast = document.querySelector('[data-toast]');
      let toastTimer;
      const showToast = (message) => { if (!toast) return; toast.textContent = message; toast.classList.remove('is-hidden'); clearTimeout(toastTimer); toastTimer = setTimeout(() => toast.classList.add('is-hidden'), 2200); };
      document.querySelector('[data-save]')?.addEventListener('click', () => showToast('保存しました（チェック用）'));
      document.querySelector('[data-feedback]')?.addEventListener('click', () => showToast('フィードバック依頼を作成しました'));
      document.querySelector('[data-guide]')?.addEventListener('click', () => showToast('手順パネルを開く想定です'));
      document.querySelector('[data-shortcut]')?.addEventListener('click', () => showToast('操作を検索（⌘K）'));
      document.querySelector('[data-autosave]')?.addEventListener('change', (event) => showToast(event.target.checked ? '自動保存を有効にしました' : '自動保存を無効にしました'));
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-editor]').forEach((avatar) => avatar.addEventListener('click', () => showToast(avatar.dataset.editor)));
      const historyPanel = document.querySelector('[data-history-panel]'); document.querySelector('[data-history]')?.addEventListener('click', () => historyPanel?.classList.toggle('is-hidden'));
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-status]').forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', () => { document.querySelectorAll('[data-status]').forEach((item) => { item.classList.toggle('is-active', item === button); item.setAttribute('aria-pressed', item === button ? 'true' : 'false'); }); showToast(`${button.querySelector('.segment-label')?.textContent}を選択しました`); }));
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]').forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', () => { const tab = button.dataset.tab; document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]').forEach((item) => { item.classList.toggle('is-active', item === button); item.setAttribute('aria-selected', item === button ? 'true' : 'false'); }); document.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]').forEach((panel) => panel.classList.toggle('is-hidden', panel.dataset.panel !== tab)); }));
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light; --bg: #f4f4f1; --sidebar: #ecece8; --surface: #ffffff; --surface-2: #f8f8f5; --surface-3: #f0f0ec; --text: #222321; --text-2: #666761; --text-3: #969791; --border: rgba(34,35,33,.12); --border-subtle: rgba(34,35,33,.075); --blue: #2775c8; --green: #258a5a; --yellow: #c88716; --shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(26,27,24,.08); }
  :root[data-theme="dark"] { color-scheme: dark; --bg: #151515; --sidebar: #101112; --surface: #191919; --surface-2: #1d1d1d; --surface-3: #202020; --text: #eeeeeb; --text-2: rgba(255,255,255,.63); --text-3: rgba(255,255,255,.43); --border: rgba(255,255,255,.085); --border-subtle: rgba(255,255,255,.055); --blue: #6ba6ff; --green: #72c98b; --yellow: #e8b84a; --shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0,0,0,.28); }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; min-width: 1080px; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Hiragino Sans", "Yu Gothic", sans-serif; font-size: 14px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  button, input, select { font: inherit; }
  button { color: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
  .app-shell { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; }
  .sidebar { width: 238px; flex: 0 0 238px; background: var(--sidebar); border-right: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 22px 18px; }
  .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--text); }
  .brand-mark { width: 28px; height: 28px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 7px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-weight: 680; font-size: 13px; }
  .brand-copy { display: grid; gap: 2px; line-height: 1.1; }.brand-copy strong { font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -.01em; }.brand-copy small { color: var(--text-3); font-size: 11px; }
  .side-rule { height: 1px; background: var(--border-subtle); margin: 24px 0 24px; }.side-kicker,.eyebrow,.comparison-label { margin: 0; color: var(--text-3); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .12em; font-weight: 700; }.side-title { margin: 12px 0 12px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; letter-spacing: -.02em; font-weight: 640; }.side-description { margin: 0; color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 12px; }.side-note { margin-top: 32px; color: var(--text-3); font-size: 11px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }.note-dot,.read-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--green); }
  .workspace { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }.topbar { height: 58px; padding: 0 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }.crumbs { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: var(--text-3); font-size: 12px; }.crumbs a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }.crumbs strong { color: var(--text-2); font-weight: 580; }.top-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }.read-only { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; color: var(--text-3); font-size: 11px; }.icon-button,.more-button { border: 1px solid var(--border); background: transparent; border-radius: 6px; width: 30px; height: 30px; display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--text-2); }.icon-button:hover,.more-button:hover { background: var(--surface-3); }.avatar { width: 27px; height: 27px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--surface-3); border: 1px solid var(--border); display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--text-2); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; }
  .page-content { max-width: 1220px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 42px 48px 64px; }.intro-row { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 28px; }.intro-row h2 { margin: 10px 0 8px; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -.025em; font-weight: 650; }.lede { margin: 0; max-width: 620px; color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.65; }.version { color: var(--text-3); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 4px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .workspace-frame { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 9px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); overflow: hidden; }.frame-topline { min-height: 68px; padding: 0 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }.workspace-context { display: flex; gap: 11px; align-items: center; }.context-mark { width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--surface-3); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--text-2); font-size: 12px; }.workspace-context div { display: grid; gap: 3px; }.context-label { color: var(--text-3); font-size: 11px; }.workspace-context strong { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 630; letter-spacing: -.01em; }.frame-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }.quiet-button,.utility-button,.secondary-button,.primary-button { border-radius: 6px; height: 32px; padding: 0 11px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 570; }.quiet-button { color: var(--text-2); }.quiet-button span { color: var(--text-3); margin-left: 6px; font-weight: 450; }.quiet-button:hover,.utility-button:hover,.secondary-button:hover { background: var(--surface-3); }.more-button { width: 32px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .status-row { min-height: 58px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }.segmented { display: inline-flex; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 7px; overflow: hidden; }.segment { min-width: 94px; height: 34px; border: 0; border-right: 1px solid var(--border); background: transparent; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 7px; }.segment:last-child { border-right: 0; }.segment:hover { background: var(--surface-3); }.segment.is-active { background: var(--surface-3); }.segment-label { font-weight: 600; }.segment-meta { color: var(--text-3); font-size: 11px; }.status-message { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; color: var(--green); font-size: 11px; padding-left: 3px; }.status-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; }.is-green { background: var(--green); }.status-spacer { flex: 1; }.utility-button { color: var(--text-2); }.check-control { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; color: var(--text-2); font-size: 11px; white-space: nowrap; cursor: pointer; }.check-control input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }.fake-check { width: 15px; height: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: transparent; }.check-control input:checked + .fake-check { background: var(--blue); border-color: var(--blue); }.check-control input:checked + .fake-check::after { content: "✓"; color: #fff; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1; }.select-control { position: relative; }.select-control select { appearance: none; height: 34px; min-width: 137px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--text-2); padding: 0 27px 0 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; }.select-chevron { position: absolute; pointer-events: none; right: 9px; top: 8px; color: var(--text-3); }
  .title-row { min-height: 76px; padding: 16px 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; }.title-copy { display: grid; gap: 5px; min-width: 0; }.title-copy h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -.02em; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }.title-copy span { color: var(--text-3); font-size: 11px; }.collab { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: var(--text-2); font-size: 11px; white-space: nowrap; }.collab-separator { width: 1px; height: 14px; background: var(--border); }.presence { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; }.presence i { width: 19px; height: 19px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid var(--surface); margin-left: -5px; background: #8c9ab4; }.presence i:first-child { margin-left: 0; background: #d38f74; }.presence i:last-child { background: #a7bc83; }
  .action-row { min-height: 54px; padding: 8px 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; }.tab-list { display: flex; align-items: stretch; gap: 18px; }.tab { position: relative; height: 45px; border: 0; background: transparent; padding: 0 1px; color: var(--text-3); font-size: 12px; }.tab:hover,.tab.is-active { color: var(--text); }.tab.is-active::after { content: ""; position: absolute; bottom: -1px; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--blue); border-radius: 2px 2px 0 0; }.count { margin-left: 3px; color: var(--text-3); }.primary-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding-bottom: 8px; }.secondary-button { color: var(--text-2); }.primary-button { background: var(--blue); border-color: var(--blue); color: #fff; min-width: 86px; }.primary-button:hover { filter: brightness(1.08); }.primary-button:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
  .panel-preview { margin: 0 20px 20px; padding: 18px 20px; min-height: 126px; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--surface-2); }.editor-line { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 12px; line-height: 1.75; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 12px; }.line-number { color: var(--text-3); text-align: right; user-select: none; }.line-text { color: var(--text-2); }.muted-line { color: var(--text-3); }.inline-tag { color: var(--yellow); }.preview-heading { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 620; margin-bottom: 8px; }.panel-preview p { margin: 0; color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.6; }.is-hidden { display: none !important; }
  .comparison { margin-top: 18px; padding: 18px 2px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; }.comparison div { display: grid; gap: 7px; }.comparison strong { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 620; }.comparison p { max-width: 510px; margin: 0; color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.65; font-size: 12px; }.menu-popover { position: fixed; top: 90px; right: 34px; width: 190px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 7px; background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow); z-index: 3; }.menu-popover button { width: 100%; height: 31px; border: 0; border-radius: 4px; text-align: left; padding: 0 9px; background: transparent; color: var(--text-2); font-size: 12px; }.menu-popover button:hover { background: var(--surface-3); color: var(--text); }.toast { position: fixed; left: 50%; bottom: 24px; transform: translateX(-50%); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow); padding: 9px 13px; color: var(--text-2); font-size: 12px; }.sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); }
  @media (max-width: 1180px) { .page-content { padding-inline: 30px; }.status-row { flex-wrap: wrap; }.status-spacer { display: none; }.title-row { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; padding-block: 15px; }.comparison { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; } }
</style>

<style>
  .created-by { color: var(--text-3); font-size: 10px !important; }
  .created-by strong { color: var(--text-2); font-weight: 600; }
  .history-avatars { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; }
  .history-avatar { width: 24px; height: 24px; margin-left: -5px; border: 2px solid var(--surface); border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; color: #fff; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; transition: transform 120ms ease; }
  .history-avatar:first-child { margin-left: 0; }
  .history-avatar:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); z-index: 1; }
  .avatar-uk { background: #4b79a7; }.avatar-ms { background: #a45f4f; }.avatar-kt { background: #718e61; }
  .history-link { border: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--text-2); padding: 0; font-size: 10px; cursor: pointer; }
